{
  "title": "Oil Rich Moroccan Chicken Tagine",
  "description": "A winey and velvety Moroccan dish featuring stir-fry vegetables, perfect for a post-workout meal, cooked in a copper pot for added richness.",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
  "diet": [
